 588:../../Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/api/sockets.c ****  * delete before!
 589:../../Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/api/sockets.c ****  *
 590:../../Middlewares/Third_Party/LwIP/src/api/sockets.c ****  * @param sock the socket to free
